# Biogenic Upgrade: a single target takes all three counters (CR 601.2d) and doubles them to six, which a 0/2 Ornithopter shows
# as a 6/8; the spell costs {4}{G}{G}, so six mana from two Black Lotuses pays it exactly.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Biogenic Upgrade
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Biogenic Upgrade.Cast
! Bot1.Divide()
! Bot1.Divide(Ornithopter: 2)
! Bot1.Divide(Ornithopter: 4)
Bot1.Divide(Ornithopter: 3)
